t(72, 80, """... it, and that if you obtain it you do not broadcast it or tell people about it, and it remains only between you and Allah the Exalted. This requires that your soul has moved to the world of the spirit, not that you are immersed in the darkness of people and desires, praying 10 thousand rak'ahs a day and saying: I want karamat .. Then you want charlatanry, not to see with your own eyes what steadies your heart so that you are aided, by the Most Merciful's permission, on the hard and desolate path, for it truly is desolate and hard, and a very great challenge may confront you on earth, as if the world were shut tight upon you, so you ask Allah the Exalted for a breach of physics, not as a request for elevation but as the request of the compelled one in distress! And we do not believe any person who comes and says: I move from place to place, because this is a great door of fitnah for people; we shut it at once, before giving any chance at all for it to be opened, and we reject it completely and categorically .. This is the method.

In conclusion, we never, ever worship Allah the Exalted so that He will breach something for us, hallowed be His names. It is enough for us to live worshipping Him, by His grace and favor upon us, with a good, successful worship to which He guides us as a favor from Him, and to die without any wonders or breaches of physics; that does not matter, because we do ((not)) worship Allah the Exalted for interests on earth, nor to tell and recount the stories that happened to us, nor to talk about details; we worship our Great Lord for Him, in Him and for His sake, and this is what must occupy us 24 hours/24 hours, and nothing else.""")

t(72, 830, """It set out from Ethiopia .. covered the west of Yemen, then turned toward the sea before reaching the east of Yemen and the Sultanate of Oman, then reached India and covered parts of it! This is a clear message .. for those who fear punishments on earth and from the sky .. The message is: Allah the Exalted is the Owner of everything. He says to the wind: send the ash to that place and keep it away from that place .. Or He commands the volcanic ash itself, without any wind or any air, and says to it: move away ...""")

t(72, 2075, """If you are told the whole world has caught fire .. be with Allah the Great, our Lord .. taking the means after, not before, turning to Allah the Exalted .. Months ago I saw a dream of glad tidings for people .. I saw that I was in a ground-floor house that is not my current house .. sitting on a prayer rug throughout the dream, praying and supplicating; then very strong explosions took place outside the house, which I saw while inside the house on the prayer rug without going outside, so I prostrated to Allah the Great, our Lord, the Most Merciful, for a period of ...""")

t(73, 755, """The amount of fatigue, pain, trial, strain, toil and exhaustion that you may pay from your blood, your self, your soul and everything your mind can and cannot imagine, if you decide to hold fast to justice in your personal life and say: No .. I will not wrong anyone, is an amount of psychological and physical aches and pains of which the least that can be said is that they are a painful torment, a lasting blaze and great agonies. Many people tire of paying the price at its beginning, so they back down and change their deeds from justice ...""")
